OL,3,GNEWSATongues a talking point in accent
OL,4,Astudy
OL,5,
OL,6,FLinguists are looking for volunteers -
OL,7,Fand their tongues - to help them better
OL,8,Funderstand variations in north-west
OL,9,FEngland accents.
OL,11,FProfessor of phonetics at Lancaster
OL,12,FUniversity Claire Nance said her team
OL,13,Fwas looking for 40 people in Barrow,
OL,14,FCumbria, to help with their study.
OL,16,FThe scientists are seeking to better
OL,17,Funderstand how tongue position can
OL,18,Faffect accents.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
